==============================================================================================================
FIGURE VALIDATION
==============================================================================================================
- Route geometries were dissolved to one feature per route.
- Raw February and July scooter volumes are NOT directly compared through colour.
- Route intensity is normalized per 1,000 analyzed scooter trips in each season.
- Winter and summer use the same colour and line-width scale.
- Colour is the primary intensity encoding; line-width variation is deliberately modest.
- candidate_trip_mentions may count one scooter trip against multiple compatible PT routes.
- Therefore the mapped measure is correctly labelled as route-overlap MENTIONS per 1,000 scooter trips.
- Direct-route compatibility represents potential competition, not observed mode substitution.
